viettelex (1.0.4) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Công cụ văn bản cho vùng chọn: Thêm dấu, HOA, thường, Hoa Đầu Từ,
    Hoa đầu câu, Xoá dấu (gói viettelex-text-tools).
  * Giao diện tiếng Anh cho app cài đặt.
  * Icon khay Vᴛ / E giống thanh menu macOS.
  * Tự cập nhật một chạm: Giới thiệu → Kiểm tra cập nhật (polkit).
  * Gói gộp `viettelex` + lệnh cài một dòng:
    curl -fsSL https://viettelex.com/install.sh | bash
  * Sửa gõ dấu khi đang chọn chữ trong app GTK3 (Firefox, Chromium...).
  * Gói nhỏ hơn: viettelex-text-tools 17,5 → 5 MB.
  * ---
  * Text tools for the selection: add tones, UPPER, lower, Title Case,
    Sentence case, remove tones (viettelex-text-tools package).
  * English user interface for the settings app.
  * Vᴛ / E tray icons matching the macOS menu bar.
  * One-click self-update: About → Check for updates (polkit).
  * `viettelex` metapackage + one-line install command.
  * Fix tone marks being applied to old text while a selection is active
    in GTK3 apps (Firefox, Chromium...).
  * Smaller packages: viettelex-text-tools 17.5 → 5 MB.

 -- VietTelex Maintainers <maintainers@viettelex.invalid>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

viettelex (1.0.3) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * GNOME Wayland: real focused-app id via portal GetRunningApplications
    monitor (per-app memory + no-underline mode on Ubuntu).
  * Terminals (GTK2/3 IBus, fcitx5-gtk/qt): Direct mode, forwarded BackSpace
    + text, no underline.
  * Preedit without underline by default (setting "Gạch chân chữ đang gõ").

 -- VietTelex Maintainers <maintainers@viettelex.invalid>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 23:00:00 +0000

viettelex (1.0.2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Surrounding mode: generic app ids/terminals/Firefox/gnome-shell use
    preedit; selection guard; IBus surrounding proven per focus.
  * Packaging: Fcitx5 recommends fcitx5-frontend-qt6 (noble+), IBus recommends
    ibus-gtk3 and ibus-gtk4.
  * Settings: new "App compatibility" tab with copyable fixes (Chrome/Electron
    on Wayland, kitty, JetBrains, rofi, GNOME overview, Snap + Fcitx5 on 22.04,
    terminals).

 -- VietTelex Maintainers <maintainers@viettelex.invalid>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:00:00 +0000

